      "id": "5",
      "title": "Unit tests for useAuditHistory hook",
      "description": "Create `dashboard/frontend/components/editor/use-audit-history.test.ts` with hook tests.\n\nUse `renderHook` and `act` from `@testing-library/react`. Use `fireEvent.keyDown(document, { key: 'Escape' })` for keyboard tests.\n\n**describe('useAuditHistory')**\n\n**describe('initial state')**\n- it('starts with selectedRunIndex=0, compareIndices=null, isComparing=false')\n\n**describe('selectRun')**\n- it('sets selectedRunIndex to given index')\n- it('toggles back to 0 when selecting current index')\n- it('clamps to auditCount-1 when index exceeds bounds')\n- it('clears compareIndices when selecting a run')\n\n**describe('shiftSelectRun')**\n- it('is no-op when auditCount is 1')\n- it('enters comparison mode with sorted indices')\n- it('cancels comparison when clicking existing compare index')\n- it('replaces older index when third dot shift-clicked')\n- it('prevents comparing a run with itself')\n\n**describe('escape key')**\n- it('exits comparison mode on first Escape')\n- it('deselects run on Escape when not comparing')\n- it('is no-op at default state')\n- it('handles two rapid Escape presses correctly')\n\n**describe('clamping')**\n- it('clamps selectedRunIndex when auditCount decreases')\n- it('clears compareIndices when auditCount makes indices invalid')\n- it('handles auditCount going to 0')\n\nFor rerender tests (clamping), use `renderHook` with `initialProps` and call `rerender({ auditCount: newValue })`.",
