    {
      "id": "6",
      "title": "Create VerdictDot interactive button component",
      "description": "Create `dashboard/frontend/components/editor/VerdictDot.tsx` — a button component replacing the existing static `fv-verdict-dot` spans.\n\nProps: `status` ('pass'|'warn'|'fail'), `selected` (boolean), `compareSelected` (boolean), `isLatest` (boolean), `onClick` (callback), `onShiftClick` (callback), `tooltip` (string), `tabIndex` (number).\n\nRendering rules:\n- Render as `<button>` with class `fv-verdict-dot` preserved for styling continuity.\n- Size: 6px default, 8px when `selected`, `compareSelected`, or `isLatest`.\n- Color: map status to `--color-emerald` / `--color-amber` / `--color-red`.\n- Opacity: 1.0 for latest/selected/compareSelected, 0.5 otherwise. Hover: 0.8.\n- Selection ring: `box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--color-border)` when `selected`. `box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--color-accent)` when `compareSelected`. Compare ring hover adds `--color-accent-glow` shadow.\n- Hit area: pad the `<button>` to at least 24x24px with the visual dot centered.\n- Pressed state: `transform: scale(0.9)`.\n- Focus: `outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent)` with 2px offset.\n- Tooltip: native `title` attribute set to `tooltip` prop.\n- Click handler: check `event.shiftKey` — if true, call `onShiftClick`; otherwise call `onClick`.\n\nAccessibility:\n- `aria-label=\"Audit run from {tooltip}, verdict: {status}\"`. When selected, append \", selected\".\n- `aria-pressed={selected || compareSelected}`.\n- `tabIndex` prop passed through for roving tabindex (caller controls).\n\nMotion: `transition: opacity 120ms ease-out, transform 120ms ease-out, box-shadow 120ms ease-out`. Under `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`, set `transition: none`.\n\nExport the component as default and as named export `VerdictDot`.",
      "acceptance_criteria": "- [test] VerdictDot renders a <button> element with class fv-verdict-dot\n- [test] aria-label includes relative timestamp and verdict status\n- [test] aria-pressed reflects selected or compareSelected state\n- [test] Click with shiftKey=true calls onShiftClick, not onClick\n- [test] Click without shiftKey calls onClick, not onShiftClick\n- [manual] Selected dot shows box-shadow ring using --color-border\n- [manual] Compare-selected dot shows box-shadow ring using --color-accent\n- [manual] Button hit area is at least 24x24px via padding\n- [manual] prefers-reduced-motion: reduce disables all transitions\n- [lint] No hardcoded color values — all colors reference CSS custom properties",
      "depends_on": [],
      "agent_model": "sonnet",
      "files_touched": [
        "dashboard/frontend/components/editor/VerdictDot.tsx"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "7",
      "title": "Create RunHeader and ComparisonHeader banner components",
      "description": "Create two small presentational components in separate files.\n\n**`dashboard/frontend/components/editor/RunHeader.tsx`**\n\nProps: `relativeTime` (string), `onBackToLatest` (callback).\n\nRenders a horizontal bar with:\n- Left: \"Viewing audit from {relativeTime}\" in `--font-mono`, 10px, weight 400, `--color-text-tertiary`.\n- Right: \"← Latest\" link in `--font-mono`, 10px, weight 500, `--color-accent`. On click calls `onBackToLatest`.\n- Background: `var(--color-bg)`. Border-bottom: `1px solid var(--color-border)`.\n- Padding: `6px 12px`.\n- `role=\"status\"`, `aria-live=\"polite\"` on the container.\n- Entry animation: opacity 0→1 + max-height 0→40px over 150ms ease. Exit: reverse in 100ms ease-in. Under reduced motion, instant.\n\n**`dashboard/frontend/components/editor/ComparisonHeader.tsx`**\n\nProps: `olderTime` (string), `newerTime` (string), `olderCount` (number), `newerCount` (number).\n\nRenders a stacked layout:\n- Row 1: \"Comparing: {olderTime} → {newerTime}\" in `--font-mono`, 11px, weight 500, `--color-text`.\n- Row 2: \"{olderCount} issues → {newerCount} issues\" in `--font-mono`, 11px, weight 500. Delta shown as parenthesized signed integer: `(−3)` or `(+2)` or `(0)`. Color: `--color-emerald` if newerCount < olderCount, `--color-red` if greater, `--color-text-tertiary` if equal.\n- Background: `var(--color-bg)`. Padding: `10px 12px`.\n- `role=\"status\"`, `aria-live=\"polite\"`. Screen reader announcement: \"Comparing audit from {olderTime} with {newerTime}. {olderCount} issues to {newerCount} issues.\"\n- Same entry/exit animation as RunHeader.\n\nBoth components export named and default exports.",
      "acceptance_criteria": "- [test] RunHeader renders relative timestamp text and Latest link\n- [test] RunHeader Latest link uses --color-accent and calls onBackToLatest on click\n- [test] RunHeader has role=status and aria-live=polite\n- [test] ComparisonHeader renders both timestamps and issue counts with delta\n- [test] ComparisonHeader delta uses --color-emerald when issues decreased\n- [test] ComparisonHeader delta uses --color-red when issues increased\n- [test] ComparisonHeader has role=status and aria-live=polite\n- [lint] No hardcoded color or font values — all reference CSS custom properties",
