    {
      "id": "8",
      "title": "Create ComparisonView grouped findings component",
      "description": "Create `dashboard/frontend/components/editor/ComparisonView.tsx`.\n\nProps: `olderAudit` (SpeedAuditResult), `newerAudit` (SpeedAuditResult), `onExit` (callback).\n\nInternal logic:\n- Import `computeComparison` from `./audit-history-utils` (created in Task 2). Call it with the two audits to get `{ removed, unchanged, added }` arrays.\n- Render three sections in order: Removed, Unchanged, Added.\n\nSection rendering:\n- Each section has a header using existing `fv-group-header` class pattern: `--font-mono`, 10px, weight 500, `--color-text-tertiary`. Text: \"Removed\", \"Unchanged\", or \"Added\".\n- Section gap: `4px` between sections.\n- If a section has zero items, render \"(none)\" in `--font-sans`, 12px, `--color-text-tertiary`, italic.\n- Each section group gets `role=\"group\"` with `aria-label`: \"Removed findings\", \"Unchanged findings\", \"Added findings\".\n\nFinding row rendering:\n- Removed rows: text in `--color-emerald` at 60% opacity with `text-decoration: line-through`. Background tint: `rgba(68, 204, 119, 0.08)`.\n- Added rows: text in `--color-red` at 80% opacity. Background tint: `rgba(239, 68, 100, 0.08)`.\n- Unchanged rows: standard finding text styling (`--color-text-secondary`, 13px, `--font-sans`).\n- Row padding: `8px 12px`. Hover: `--color-bg-card-hover` background.\n- Each row shows severity icon and truncated message (truncate at 65 chars with ellipsis).\n\nFooter: \"Exit comparison\" link at bottom. `--font-sans`, 11px, `--color-text-tertiary`. Hover: `--color-text-secondary`. On click: call `onExit`.\n\nThe entire component is wrapped in a scrollable container. Content swap uses the existing `fvFadeIn` animation (150ms ease, opacity 0→1).",
      "acceptance_criteria": "- [test] ComparisonView renders Removed, Unchanged, Added sections in that order\n- [test] Empty section displays (none) text\n- [test] Exit comparison link calls onExit callback on click\n- [test] Each section group has role=group and appropriate aria-label\n- [test] computeComparison is imported from audit-history-utils, not reimplemented\n- [test] Finding messages truncated at 65 chars with ellipsis\n- [manual] Removed rows have line-through text decoration and emerald tint background\n- [manual] Added rows have red-tinted background at rgba(239, 68, 100, 0.08)",
      "depends_on": [
