    {
      "id": "9",
      "title": "Integrate audit history into IntelPanel",
      "description": "Modify `dashboard/frontend/components/editor/IntelPanel.tsx` to wire all Phase 1 utilities and Phase 2 components into the existing Findings tab.\n\nImports to add:\n- `useAuditHistory` from `./use-audit-history` (Task 3)\n- `formatRelativeTime`, `getPersistentIssues` from `./audit-history-utils` (Tasks 1, 2)\n- `VerdictDot` from `./VerdictDot` (Task 6)\n- `RunHeader` from `./RunHeader` (Task 7)\n- `ComparisonHeader` from `./ComparisonHeader` (Task 7)\n- `ComparisonView` from `./ComparisonView` (Task 8)\n\n**Hook wiring:**\nCall `useAuditHistory(recentAudits)` at the top of the Findings tab render path. Destructure `selectedRunIndex`, `compareIndices`, `selectRun`, `addCompareIndex`, `clearSelection`, `clearComparison`, `selectedAudit`, `isComparing`.\n\n**Verdict dots replacement:**\nReplace existing `<span className=\"fv-verdict-dot\">` elements with `<VerdictDot>` components. For each audit in `recentAudits`, render a VerdictDot with:\n- `status={audit.status}`, `selected={selectedRunIndex === i}`, `compareSelected={compareIndices?.includes(i)}`, `isLatest={i === 0}`\n- `onClick={() => selectRun(i)}`, `onShiftClick={() => addCompareIndex(i)}`\n- `tooltip={formatRelativeTime(audit.ranAt)}`\n\nWrap the dots in a container with `role=\"toolbar\"`, `aria-label=\"Audit history\"`, `aria-orientation=\"horizontal\"`. Implement roving tabindex: track `focusedDotIndex` in local state. Only the focused dot gets `tabIndex={0}`, others get `tabIndex={-1}`. Arrow Left/Right move focus, wrapping at boundaries. Enter/Space activate the focused dot.\n\n**Persistent issue count:**\nWhen viewing latest (selectedRunIndex === 0) and recentAudits.length >= 2, compute `persistentIssues = getPersistentIssues(recentAudits[0], recentAudits[1])`. If persistentIssues.size > 0, display count in verdict summary area using `--color-amber`.\n\n**Run header:**\nRender `<RunHeader>` between verdict strip and findings list when `selectedRunIndex !== 0 && !isComparing`. Pass `relativeTime={formatRelativeTime(selectedAudit.ranAt)}` and `onBackToLatest={() => selectRun(0)}`.\n\n**Comparison mode:**\nWhen `isComparing`, render `<ComparisonHeader>` with both audits' timestamps and issue counts. Below it, render `<ComparisonView>` with the two selected audits and `onExit={clearComparison}`. Hide the normal findings list.\n\n**Findings list modification:**\nWhen not comparing, pass `recentAudits[selectedRunIndex]` to `buildFindings` instead of always `recentAudits[0]`. The previous audit for delta is `recentAudits[selectedRunIndex + 1]` (may be undefined). Apply `fvFadeIn` animation class to the findings list container on content swap.\n\n**Persistent badge on finding rows:**\nIn the normal findings list, for each finding check if its issueKey is in the `persistentIssues` set. If so, append a \"persistent\" badge: `--font-sans`, 11px, weight 500, `--color-amber` text on `rgba(240, 178, 50, 0.12)` background. Only show on latest view (selectedRunIndex === 0).\n\n**Sizing card:**\nUpdate the existing sizing card to show `selectedAudit.sizing` instead of always latest. In comparison mode, if both audits have sizing and they differ, show both sizing cards stacked. If identical, show one.\n\n**Keyboard navigation:**\nAdd a keydown handler on the Findings tab container:\n- Escape: if `isComparing`, call `clearComparison`. Else if `selectedRunIndex !== 0`, call `clearSelection`. Else no-op.\n\n**Edge states:**\n- 0 audits: render no dots, no findings. Show \"No audit results yet\" centered in `--font-sans`, 12px, `--color-text-tertiary`.\n- 1 audit: single dot at full opacity, shift-click is a no-op (handled by hook). No persistent badge.\n- Error state: if recentAudits query fails, show \"Failed to load audit history\" in `--color-red` with \"Retry\" link in `--color-accent`. Hide verdict strip.\n\n**Index clamping:**\nDefensive check: `const safeIndex = Math.min(selectedRunIndex, recentAudits.length - 1)` before any recentAudits access.",
      "acceptance_criteria": "- [test] Clicking a non-latest verdict dot loads that run's findings in the panel\n- [test] Shift-clicking two dots shows ComparisonView with Removed/Unchanged/Added sections\n- [test] ComparisonHeader shows issue count delta between two selected runs\n- [test] Escape exits comparison mode first, then deselects run (two-level)\n- [test] Persistent issue count displayed in verdict summary when > 0\n- [test] Persistent badge appears on finding rows matching previous run by issueKey\n- [test] Sizing card updates to show selected run's sizing data\n- [test] 0-audit state shows 'No audit results yet' with no dots rendered\n- [test] 1-audit state renders single dot, shift-click is no-op\n- [test] Arrow Left/Right navigates between dots using roving tabindex\n- [test] Verdict strip has role=toolbar and aria-label='Audit history'\n- [test] formatRelativeTime output shown as tooltip on each dot\n- [test] RunHeader appears when viewing non-latest run with correct timestamp\n- [manual] Selected dot has a visible 2px ring",
      "depends_on": [
