      "id": "11",
      "title": "Integration tests for IntelPanel audit history behavior",
      "description": "Create `dashboard/frontend/components/editor/IntelPanel.audit-history.test.tsx` with integration tests that verify the wired-up audit history behavior within IntelPanel.\n\nTest setup: render IntelPanel (or the Findings tab section) with mock `recentAudits` data via GraphQL mock provider. Create fixture sets:\n- `threeRunFixture`: 3 audits with varying statuses and overlapping/unique issues\n- `oneRunFixture`: 1 audit\n- `zeroRunFixture`: empty array\n\n15 tests:\n1. Dot click swaps findings: click second dot, verify findings list shows that run's issues\n2. Clicking selected dot returns to latest: click dot 2 twice, verify revert\n3. Shift-click enters comparison: shift-click dot 1 then dot 3, verify ComparisonView renders\n4. Comparison shows correct delta: verify ComparisonHeader renders correct counts and sign\n5. Escape exits comparison first: enter comparison, press Escape, verify comparison gone\n6. Escape exits run selection: select dot 2, press Escape, verify return to latest\n7. 0-run empty state: render with empty array, verify \"No audit results yet\" and no dots\n8. 1-run no comparison: render with 1 audit, shift-click is no-op\n9. Persistent badge on latest: runs sharing an issue show \"persistent\" badge on latest view\n10. Persistent badge absent on historical: click dot 2, verify no persistent badges\n11. RunHeader appears for non-latest: click dot 2, verify RunHeader with timestamp\n12. RunHeader Latest link returns to latest: click link, verify findings revert\n13. Sizing card shows selected run: click dot 2, verify sizing data matches\n14. Arrow keys navigate dots: focus strip, ArrowRight moves focus\n15. Index clamping: select dot 3, re-render with 2 audits, verify no crash\n\nAll tests use `fireEvent.click`, `fireEvent.keyDown`, and RTL queries. Mock the GraphQL `recentAudits` query response.",
      "acceptance_criteria": "- [test] 15 integration tests pass covering all audit history user flows\n- [test] Dot click correctly swaps the findings list content\n- [test] Shift-click two dots renders ComparisonView\n- [test] Escape implements two-level exit (comparison first, then selection)\n- [test] 0-run and 1-run edge cases handled without errors\n- [test] Persistent badge appears only on latest view for shared issues\n- [test] Index clamping prevents out-of-bounds crash on audit prune\n- [lint] Tests use GraphQL mock provider, not direct state manipulation",
